  - `issues.sh`: `PASS=5 FAIL=0`
  - Shell syntax checks passed.
  - `insteadOf`, protected symlinks, `remote.pushDefault`, explicit `--git-dir`, and mixed positional/`--repo` destination probes behaved safely.

  Verdict: CHANGES-NEEDED

